const graphEdges=[['order','create','包含'],['order','cancel','包含'],['order','refund','待查归属'],['cancel','api','由其实现'],['cancel','doc','依据'],['cancel','test','有测试资产']];
function visibleGraphNodes(){let nodes=graphNodes.filter(n=>!state.onlyHuman||n.status==='人工确认'||(n.id==='refund'&&state.decisions.length));if(state.graphMode==='implementation')nodes=nodes.filter(n=>!['create','refund'].includes(n.id));if(state.graphMode==='coverage')nodes=nodes.filter(n=>!['create','api'].includes(n.id));if(state.graphExpanded&&!state.onlyHuman)nodes.push({id:'inventory',x:551,y:20,w:191,title:'库存释放',sub:'Agent 分析 · 2 条依据',kind:'code',color:'purple',status:'Agent 分析'});return nodes}
function graphSVG(){const nodes=visibleGraphNodes();const included=new Set(nodes.map(n=>n.id));const edges=graphEdges.filter(e=>included.has(e[0])&&included.has(e[1]));if(state.graphExpanded&&included.has('inventory'))edges.push(['create','inventory','影响待核实']);let svg=`<svg id="graph-svg" viewBox="0 0 785 590" aria-label="订单业务关系图。可用 Tab 选择节点，Enter 查看详情；列表视图提供等价内容。"><defs><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" refX="5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 6 3 0 6" fill="var(--line-strong)"/></marker><marker id="arrowBlue" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" refX="5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 6 3 0 6" fill="var(--blue)"/></marker></defs><g id="graph-transform" transform="translate(${state.pan.x} ${state.pan.y}) translate(392 295) scale(${state.zoom}) translate(-392 -295)">`;
 for(const[a,b,label]of edges){const from=nodes.find(n=>n.id===a),to=nodes.find(n=>n.id===b);if(!from||!to)continue;const x=from.x+from.w,y=from.y+34,tx=to.x,ty=to.y+34,d=`M${x} ${y}C${x+47} ${y},${tx-47} ${ty},${tx} ${ty}`,focused=state.selected==='cancel'&&(a==='cancel'||b==='cancel');svg+=`<g><path class="edge ${label.includes('待')?'uncertain':focused?'focused':''}" d="${d}" marker-end="url(#${focused?'arrowBlue':'arrow'})"/><path class="edge-hit" d="${d}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${from.title} ${label} ${to.title}" data-edge="${a}:${b}"/><text x="${(x+tx)/2}" y="${(y+ty)/2-8}" text-anchor="middle" class="edge-label">${label}</text></g>`}
 for(const n of nodes){const status=n.id==='refund'&&state.decisions.length?'人工确认':n.status;svg+=`<g class="graph-node ${state.selected===n.id?'selected':''}" transform="translate(${n.x} ${n.y})" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${n.title}，${status}" data-node="${n.id}"><rect class="node-halo" x="-5" y="-5" width="${n.w+10}" height="78" rx="16"/><rect class="node-rect" width="${n.w}" height="68" rx="11"/><rect x="12" y="13" width="26" height="26" rx="7" fill="var(--${n.color}-soft)"/><svg x="17" y="18" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--${n.color})" stroke-width="1.65" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">${icons[n.kind]}</svg><text x="47" y="28" class="node-title">${n.title}</text><text x="13" y="54" class="node-meta">${state.graphMode==='coverage'?status:n.id==='refund'&&state.decisions.length?'人工确认 · 限已支付订单':n.sub}</text>${n.id==='refund'&&!state.decisions.length?'<circle cx="162" cy="14" r="4" fill="var(--amber)"/>':''}</g>`}return svg+'</g></svg>'}
function inspector(){const n=graphNodes.find(n=>n.id===state.selected)||{title:'库存释放',color:'purple',kind:'code',status:'Agent 分析'};const isRefund=state.selected==='refund',status=isRefund&&state.decisions.length?'人工确认':n.status;return `<aside class="inspector" aria-label="${n.title}详情"><div class="inspector-heading"><div class="circle-icon ${n.color}">${icon(n.kind)}</div>${ib('close','关闭详情','close-inspector')}</div><div><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">${{order:'业务领域 · DOM-001',create:'业务功能 · BIZ-023',cancel:'业务功能 · BIZ-024',refund:'业务功能 · BIZ-025',api:'接口声明 · API-024',doc:'需求原文 · MAT-018',test:'测试资产 · MAT-029',inventory:'实现关联 · OBJ-142'}[state.selected]}</div><h2>${n.title}</h2>${tag(status,status==='人工确认'?'green':status==='需要确认'?'amber':'purple')}</div><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="详情内容">${[['summary','概览'],['evidence','证据'],['activity','活动']].map(([v,t])=>`<button role="tab" aria-selected="${state.inspectorTab===v}" data-action="inspect-tab:${v}">${t}</button>`).join('')}</div>${state.inspectorTab==='activity'?`<div class="inspector-copy">${isRefund&&state.decisions.length?'<strong>刚刚 · 人工决定已记录</strong><p>'+esc(state.decisions.at(-1).note||'确认了未支付与已支付的适用范围。')+'</p>':'<strong>09:42 · 图谱 g7</strong><p>证据核查完成。业务解释与原文引用按范围保留。</p>'}</div>`:`${state.inspectorTab==='summary'?`<p class="inspector-copy">${isRefund?'已支付订单进入退款流程；超时与部分退款的适用范围仍需确认。':state.selected==='cancel'?'下单用户可以取消未支付订单。已支付订单需进入退款流程。':'这一对象与订单业务链相关，来源、关系和已知限制分别保留。'}</p><dl class="metadata"><dt>适用范围</dt><dd>订单服务 / 来源 r8</dd><dt>图谱版本</dt><dd>g7</dd><dt>确认范围</dt><dd>${['api','doc','test'].includes(state.selected)?'原始记录，不作业务确认':isRefund&&!state.decisions.length?'尚待确认':'当前命题'}</dd></dl>`:''}<div><div class="row between"><h3 style="font-size:12px">支撑依据</h3><span class="micro">3 项</span></div>${[['code','OrderService.java','r8 · L84–112 · 状态与身份校验'],['file','订单需求.md','r8 · §3.2 · 取消与退款路径'],['test','取消订单.spec.ts','静态测试资产 · 尚未关联执行记录']].map(([ic,t,d])=>`<button class="evidence-link" data-action="evidence-preview:${t}">${icon(ic)}<span class="grow"><strong>${t}</strong><small>${d}</small></span>${icon('right')}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}<div class="inspector-footer">${isRefund?btn(state.decisions.length?'查看确认记录':'处理这个问题',state.decisions.length?'inspect-tab:activity':'review','primary'):textBtn('展开一跳关联','expand-graph')}<p style="margin-top:8px">原文与人的解释分别留痕。静态测试引用不代表测试已经通过。</p></div></aside>`}
